    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'06PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.06.20191A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2126$40 \u2013 2019 cqks 06 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2019'06'06\n\nNo. 2126$40 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 06, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunathilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms do hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.\n\nAn allotment of land depicted in below names and extents in theTracing No: CO/DSO/2017/750 dated 28.04.2018 prepared by theSurveyor General situated in the Village called Pepiliyana in theDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewa in Colombo District ofWestern Province and bounded as follows.\n\n01. Lot \u2018\u2018A\u2019\u2019 \u2013 Wetakeyyagaha Kumbura alias Ninde Kumbura,Wedawasam Madangaha Kumbura alias Peduruwe Kumbura \u2013Extent:0.0253 HectareNorth: Lot Nos. 19 and 22 of Preliminary Plan Co. 9623; East:Lot No. 22 of Preliminary Plan Co. 9623; South: Lot No. 22 ofPreliminary Plan Co. 9623; West: Lot No. 22 of Preliminary PlanCo. 9623, Euro Scan Private Company and Lot No. 19 of PreliminaryPlan Co. 9623.\n\nGayantha Karunathilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No. : 4-3/10/2017/LRB/368.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\"Mihikatha Medura\", Land Secretariat,Rajamalwatta Avenue, Battaramulla.16th March 2019.\n\n06 \u2013591\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 30242 \u2013 31 (06/2019)"
