    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'06PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.06.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that servitude of the land described below inParagraph 1 is required for a public purpose and will be acquiredunder the provisions of that Act. The land over which the saidservitude is to be acquired is given in Paragraph 2.\n\n1. Description of the Servitude.\u2013 For Access Road to Tenne-kumbura Service Reservoir of the Kundasale - Haragama Water SupplyProject.\n\n2. Description of the Land.\u2013 The allotments of land calledSemaneriya Estate and Tennekumbura Estate depicted in the AdvanceTracing No. Maha/MHN/2017/262 and dated 14.09.2017, preparedby the Surveyor-General, situated in the Villages of Semaneriya Wattaand Thannekumbura in the Grama Niladhari Divisions No. 269Ampitiya North and No. 275 Thennekumbura in the Minor Divisionof Gangawata Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisions ofKadawathsathara and Gangawata Korale in Kandy District, CentralProvince and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Semaneriya Estate \u2013 Extent: 0.0116 HectareNorth: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha) and Semeneriya Estate claimedby D. M. Jayathilaka; East: Semeneriya Estate claimed by D. M.\n\nJayathilaka, Tennekumbura Estate claimed by Creditline FinancialServices (Pvt.) Ltd. and Lot B; South: Semeneriya Estate claimed byA. M. Wijitha Bandara; West: Semeneriya Estate claimed by A. M.Wijitha Bandara and Road (Pradeshiya Sabha)."
