    "chunk_text": "2. Lot No. 522 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihamy in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.008 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 523 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihamy in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.002 Hectare.\n\n5. Lot No. 535 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: P.W. Ranbanda in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.068 Hectare.\n\n6. Lot No. 536 Name of the land: -; Description: Purul Ela; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anulawathie in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.046 Hectare.\n\n7. Lot No. 537 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anulawathie in Walaswewa; Amount: 0.010 Hectare.\n\n8. Lot No. 538 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihami Walaswewa; Amount: 0.010 Hectare.\n\n9. Lot No. 539 Name of the land: -; Description: Irrigation; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihami Walaswewa; Amount: 0.063 Hectare.\n\n10. Lot No. 540 Name of the land: Konegollayaya; Description: Chena; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: N. W. Anula Kumarihami Walaswewa; Amount: 0.013 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at Galewela Divisional Secretariat, 20th June 2019 at 10.30 a.m. And are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 13th June 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\ngfg M. U. NISHANTHA, Divisional Secretary, Galewela.\n\nDivisional Secretary\