    "chunk_text": "wxl 2126$44 - 2019 cqks ui 06 jeks n%yiam;ska\u00de - 2019'06'06\n\nNo. 2126/44 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 06, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref.No. DIVIB/LND/LADAQ/CEP/05/2015/12.Ministry of Land and Parliamentary Reforms Reference No: 4-3/7/2016/HW/388.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe as amendment by the land acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964,that the Government intends to acquire the following landswhich are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired :\n\nThe allotment of land, containing in extent of 1.1922 Hectares,Lot No. 96 (01 lot) under mentioned land shown in the SurveyorGeneral's plan of F.V.P. 1184 Supplement No. 07 and Sheet No.08 dated 31.01.2019 situated in the village of Badagne in theGrama Niladhari Division of No. 523, Kumbalanga in the MinorDivision of Ihala Wisideke Korale in the Divisional Secretary'sDivision of Ibbagamuwa in the Kurunegala District of NorthWestern Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 96Name of the Land: Saint Ivory Estate, Badagane,Meegahawatta, Kiwulewela, Henyaya; Description of Land:\n\nEstate; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Parts of theLot No. 8 and 1 (T. P 211467) are taken over Section 38 (A) ofthe Land Acquisition Act. Original ClaimantH.K.C.N.Wanigasundara.To finalize the acquisitionProcess;Extent: 1.1922Hectare."
